<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Telerj upgraded to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Telerj upgraded to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers/Patrimonio said in a report it upgraded Rio de Janeiro state-owned telecom Telerj to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- It said it estimated Telerj would post net earnings of 246 million reais in 1997 using their new projection accouting method, versus 258 million reais under the previous accounting method, the report said.</p>
</text>
